\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Master audit table. \textbf  {Provenance, since this is the paper's largest table without a per-row artifact:} the swap cells ($8/10 \to 0/20$, $23/30 \to 13/30$) and the untouched band ($20/30$) have shipped per-trial records in \texttt  {results/pod\_cells.json}; the attribution profiles are in \texttt  {results/attribution\_profiles.json}. The repair figures --- layer 1's $0/10 \to 7/10$, layer 4's place points, and the DAgger row's $3/50 \to 22/50$ --- were measured in earlier sessions and their per-trial records are \emph  {not} in this repository. They are reported here as cited history, not as cells a reader can recompute. Layers 1--4 are the placement-memorisation layers; the last row is a drift case study, \emph  {not} one of the four; it appears here only because its repair is easily mistaken for one of theirs. Two rows are deliberately not marked repaired.}}{15}{table.caption.54}\protected@file@percent }
